@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Backhand drop and lob
Backhand drop and lob, five minutes. Counter-drops first: two metres from the front wall, close to
the side wall, soft drops just above the tin, kept going. Then from the short line near the side
wall, play a soft drop, move in, and lob it before its second bounce, high above the service line so
it lands in the back corner. Collect it and repeat. Straight lobs, then cross-court.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 5:00
0:00 [go]
6% Open face. Soft hands.
18% Stay low. Bend your knees, not your back.
30% Now drop and lob. From the short line: drop, move in, and lob it straight.
42% Get under the ball. Low to high.
54% Open face. Lift it, don't hit it.
66% Now cross-court lobs. Aim high, on your half of the front wall.
80% Clip the side wall high, behind the service box.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
